{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.950000762939453,"text":"Honestly, everyone's been stopping me about this bag all day. This is the Meridian from Volanta. It's all pebbled leather with silver hardware. There's no logo on it anywhere, and my laptop actually sits flat inside it. The dress is Zimmerman, the hat is Janessa Leon, and the shoes are Aqua Zazaya. The rings are David Yerman, and this little one was my grandmother's. Everyone assumes I paid way more for it than I did, which I kind of love.","words":[{"word":"Honestly","start":0.0,"end":1.059999942779541},{"word":"everyone's","start":1.0800000429153442,"end":1.6200000047683716},{"word":"been","start":1.6200000047683716,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"stopping","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.059999942779541},{"word":"me","start":2.059999942779541,"end":2.2799999713897705},{"word":"about","start":2.2799999713897705,"end":2.4600000381469727},{"word":"this","start":2.4600000381469727,"end":2.7200000286102295},{"word":"bag","start":2.7200000286102295,"end":2.9200000762939453},{"word":"all","start":2.9200000762939453,"end":3.180000066757202},{"word":"day","start":3.180000066757202,"end":3.4600000381469727},{"word":"This","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.440000057220459},{"word":"is","start":4.440000057220459,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"the","start":4.619999885559082,"end":4.860000133514404},{"word":"Meridian","start":4.860000133514404,"end":5.239999771118164},{"word":"from","start":5.239999771118164,"end":5.639999866485596},{"word":"Volanta","start":5.639999866485596,"end":6.119999885559082},{"word":"It's","start":6.639999866485596,"end":6.820000171661377},{"word":"all","start":6.820000171661377,"end":7.300000190734863},{"word":"pebbled","start":7.300000190734863,"end":7.460000038146973},{"word":"leather","start":7.460000038146973,"end":7.800000190734863},{"word":"with","start":7.800000190734863,"end":8.380000114440918},{"word":"silver","start":8.380000114440918,"end":8.6800003051